# Google Maps Platform API key for React + Vite (@vis.gl/react-google-maps)
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and set your own key (NEVER commit `.env.local`).
#
# Quickstart (Zero-billing prototyping with Maps Demo Key):
#   1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
#   3. Generate/reveal the demo key and paste it below.
#   Note: Maps Demo Key supports Maps JS API, Places API (New), and Routes API
#   with a daily quota limit. For Roads API (v1/snapToRoads) or production usage,
#   use a standard Google Cloud API key with Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New),
#   Routes API, and Roads API enabled and restricted appropriately:
#   https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
